<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[Client</span>]</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Your partnership with Insperity grants access to the <a href="https://portalapps.insperity.com/3rdPartyTraining/skillport.aspx">Insperity Learning Portal</a> which houses books, self-paced trainings, and other professional development opportunities. Your employees have access to this platform at no additional charge. Our learning and development solutions are designed to meet the wide range of challenges facing today’s small businesses. Our online course library is broad enough to support specific business goals, while also providing individual skill development. Please feel welcome to share the attached flyer with your employees to give an overview of some of the available content across multiple delivery modes, as well as the sample below.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You are welcome to disseminate the below email to your employees as appropriate to remind them of the resources available to them.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please always feel welcome to reach out to me with any questions.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[signature]</font></div><div><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Dear [<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Team Members</span>]&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">We are excited to remind you that through our Insperity relationship you have access to an array of training and development resources.&nbsp; We encourage you to leverage the access to the professional development opportunities available to you at no charge.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">These trainings can be found on Insperity Premier by navigating to the <a href="https://portalapps.insperity.com/3rdPartyTraining/skillport.aspx">Learning Portal.</a>&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>The Learning Portal supports various learning needs:</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Leader development</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Employee development</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Personal wellbeing</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Working remote</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Microsoft Office suite and other software</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Select IT and Business certification prep courses</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Environmental, Safety &amp; Health, including OSHA compliance</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Legal compliance</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Resources are available for multiple learning styles:</b>&nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Self-paced courses</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Instructor-led virtual training available for registration</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Videos</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Book Summaries</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Articles</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Manager Administrator Options</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>View employee transcripts</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Enroll employees in courses</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Create and assign curriculum for groups of courses</font></div><div><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Run reports</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Get started</b>&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Log in at <a href="https://portal.insperity.com/cs/nsp/index"><font color="#000099">elearning.insperity.com</font></a> and enter your Insperity® Premier login information.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please reach out to the Insperity Contact Center at 866.715.3552, 7 a.m. – 7 p.m. CT&nbsp;</font></div><div><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>